            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mahjong solitaire. With cats.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meow-Jong is a single-player mahjong solitaire game with cat-picture tiles for Windows, macOS and Linux. Pick one of 160 board layouts, find two free tiles with the same cat, remove them, and clear the board. Every board is dealt solvable, with hint, undo and reshuffle when you need another way forward. No ads, no in-app purchases, no timer that ends the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick a board. Find a pair.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for matching tiles that are free to play, then remove pairs to uncover your next move. Work through different board layouts and see how much you can clear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is in the box</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>160 boards, from a 28-tile warm-up to 160-tile challenges, including the classic 144-tile Turtle</li><li>44 cat tiles; two tiles match when the cats are identical</li><li>Every deal is solvable by construction; reshuffle re-deals what is left</li><li>Hint, undo, score and clock</li><li>Steam Achievements and Steam Trading Cards</li><li>Native Linux build (players report it runs on Steam Deck; not Deck Verified)</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A little game for your next break</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you already enjoy mahjong solitaire or are trying tile matching for the first time, Meow-Jong keeps the focus on the puzzle, with cat-themed artwork and a colorful presentation.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mahjong solitaire. With cats.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meow-Jong is a single-player mahjong solitaire game with cat-picture tiles for Windows, macOS and Linux. Pick one of 160 board layouts, find two free tiles with the same cat, remove them, and clear the board. Every board is dealt solvable, with hint, undo and reshuffle when you need another way forward. No ads, no in-app purchases, no timer that ends the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick a board. Find a pair.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for matching tiles that are free to play, then remove pairs to uncover your next move. Work through different board layouts and see how much you can clear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is in the box</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>160 boards, from a 28-tile warm-up to 160-tile challenges, including the classic 144-tile Turtle</li><li>44 cat tiles; two tiles match when the cats are identical</li><li>Every deal is solvable by construction; reshuffle re-deals what is left</li><li>Hint, undo, score and clock</li><li>Steam Achievements and Steam Trading Cards</li><li>Native Linux build (players report it runs on Steam Deck; not Deck Verified)</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A little game for your next break</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you already enjoy mahjong solitaire or are trying tile matching for the first time, Meow-Jong keeps the focus on the puzzle, with cat-themed artwork and a colorful presentation.</p>",
