                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "If youre looking for a cute mahjong puzzle game, this is pretty good.\n\nIn total, there are 120 puzzles, some difficult and some easy. My only complaint is that I wish there were some more of the more difficult ones. Some of these almost border on too easy, but for a starter at mahjong, theyre probably perfect. The game scores you on how quickly you can complete the puzzles, givng you a rating of 1 to 3 stars. The achieves are mostly for completing puzzles and completing them and getting 3 stars.\n\nThe game music is on a loop and it gets a bit old after awhile, but its pretty nice. Also, if you leave the game sound on, the game \"meows\" at you each time you match tiles, which can be kind of annoying after awhile.\n\nBug wise, I only found one. If I ran out of matches and the popup window came up to reshuffle, if I clicked the \"shuffle\" button too quickly, sometimes the tiles wouldnt respawn. Solution was to slow down and it worked perfect.\n\nOverall, there isnt much to say. If you like mahjong, want a mahjong game thats good for a beginner, or a good kids puzzle game, could do much worse than this game. More than worth a recommend, especially if you catch it on sale",
